# AWS — CloudWatch Logs (Quick Recipes)

Created: 2026-02-02 05:37 UTC  
Last reviewed: 2026-02-02 05:37 UTC

## Find Recent Logs for a Service
- Identify log group (by ECS service, Lambda, or app convention).
- Narrow to a time window and request id / user id.

## Logs Insights (Example Queries)
Errors in last 1 hour:
```sql
fields @timestamp, @message
| filter @message like /ERROR|Exception/
| sort @timestamp desc
| limit 200
```

Requests for a user:
```sql
fields @timestamp, @message
| filter @message like /user_id=123/
| sort @timestamp desc
| limit 200
```

## Tips
- Start with the smallest time window that reproduces the issue.
- Copy/paste exact request ids from client logs where possible.

